### 방 만들기
POST http://localhost:8081/rooms?member=10
Content-Type: application/json

{"member_id": 30}

### 같은 방 다시 (200 기대)
POST http://localhost:8081/rooms?member=30
Content-Type: application/json

{"member_id": 10}

### 자기 자신 (400 기대)
POST http://localhost:8081/rooms?member=10
Content-Type: application/json

{"member_id": 10}